Dwarf armor class is 10.  It's only 4 if you #ifdef out the monster item use 
routines; otherwise their AC comes only from what they're wearing.  If you
can't hit that dwarf, maybe that's because it's got a dwarven mithril coat,
a shield, and maybe a hat and shoes.
